  "description": "With its classy looks, exacting attention to detail and practical integration, the Alpenchallenge AL AMP ONE Bosch e-bike could only be a BMC. Built with a premium, smooth-welded aluminum frame and fork, it features a powerful Bosch Performance CX Smart System drive unit that provides effortless assistance on every ride. The large 625Wh PowerTube integrated battery extends your range, letting you go further without breaking a sweat.\nThe frame is powder-coated for enhanced durability, protecting it from scratches when storing or locking your bike outdoors. For added versatility, fender mounts allow easy installation of full-size fenders when needed.\nFor both comfort and control, the bike is equipped with the BMC ICS MTT suspension stem. The drivetrain primarily consists of a Shimano CUES 11-speed system, paired with Miranda Classic cranks, while 40mm Pirelli Cinturato Gravel H tires deliver a smooth and reliable ride on a variety of surfaces.",
